{195}{I hope you are pleased with yourself, cretin! Delivering an honorable being like Mr. Throgg to his death! I spit on you! [He spits on you.]}{I hope you are pleased with yourself, cretin! Delivering an honorable being like Mr. Throgg to his death! I spit on you! [He spits on you.]}{}{}{}{ }
{196}{I hope you are pleased with yourself, cretin! Killing an honorable being like Mr. Throgg! I spit on you! [He spits on you.]}{I hope you are pleased with yourself, cretin! Killing an honorable being like Mr. Throgg! I spit on you! [He spits on you.]}{}{}{}{ }
{197}{Splendid! Splendid! Thank you oh so much for your help. You've done the city of Tarant a great service.}{Splendid! Splendid! Thank you oh so much for your help. You've done the city of Tarant a great service.}{}{}{}{ }
{198}{Thank you. Good day.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{205}{Please, you must listen to me. These are noble beings you are dealing with, not savages!}{Please, you must listen to me. These are noble beings you are dealing with, not savages!}{}{}{}{ }
{206}{What would you do if you had been taken from your natural home and forced to work under these conditions?}{What would you do if you had been taken from your natural home and forced to work under these conditions?}{}{}{}{ }
{207}{This situation calls for compassion and restraint! Please!}{This situation calls for compassion and restraint! Please!}{}{}{}{ }
{208}{Your presence here is exacerbating this situation! If you leave, I can bring this to a satisfactory conclusion!}{Your presence here is exacerbating this situation! If you leave, I can bring this to a satisfactory conclusion!}{}{}{}{ }
